[Desktop Entry]
Type=Service
Name=Wrong Keyboard Layout
Name[ru]=Неверная раскладка
Comment=Finds applications typed in the wrong keyboard layout: ыеуфь → Steam
Comment[ru]=Находит приложения, набранные не в той раскладке: ыеуфь → Steam
Icon=input-keyboard
X-KDE-ServiceTypes=Plasma/Runner
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=krunner_layoutfix
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Author=FelixDes
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Website=https://github.com/FelixDes/krunner-layoutfix
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Version=0.1.0
X-KDE-PluginInfo-License=MIT
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=true
X-Plasma-API=DBus
X-Plasma-API-Minimum-Version=2.0
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=io.github.felixdes.KRunnerLayoutFix
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/runner
X-Plasma-Request-Actions-Once=true
X-Plasma-Runner-Min-Letter-Count=2
